          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwadaah Balaamu gideaba ghabwariiy NG'UTAMIIDA ghoadaw Israeli ghawooda, ea mawa, gawuurji gideaba eawoojisu, ghabwar lagheanga, ghwayam geaw ak googeal gheanyangaaschi dareapcheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gagatkat Balaamu gheanyangaaschi ak ghwadaah fuga Israeli, nea gabeeliisiinyi dooshinga; ak ghwahidu guroorooda ASEETA headaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghang'at ghwasiildeangaaschi nea gwayi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwayeat nyarasta Balaki aba badayda Balaamu ak ghabwar geadi, ghwalamda Balaki ak gwayeesha Balaamu, “Geaguurneey mooshteaynean weajoodigeasu, ak ging'ulayi, ak ghamneawa ea niidawi ghawooda muuchi niba samwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa ng'eada mang'awa una ghoah; aba gideaba ‘geagasayi dagoonyi gida,’ ak ging'ulayi niheawa NG'UTAMIIDA goonda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Balaamu Balaki, “Neada ea miidarukusa fugaagu iijeagu gideaba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Eara gwachi gagoonan Balaki gheanyi nea ghwanyiit lapiya ea dahaabu, maydasuut moonghooda ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak geasinyi ng'asheanda miy, ghana ng'asheanda muy, aba gideagasiidi aniini; gichea gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA gichea dargu aniini’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Balaamu ghwaramoar dea huuydean",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaygang'ula fuga Amaleki, ak gwarugu ghwasiildeang'su, nea gwayi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
